msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:341 d0ea6223a1a84ebaad5ebeb04aeacaa8
msgid ""
"The \"Clear Selection\" will clear the previously selected processing "
"parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:344 cf0be5ea4ea84371ba659f7d798306e7
msgid ""
"Once you have selected the model and the processing parameters, you will "
"see the total cost of your processing counted in Mapflow credits. Upon "
"registration, you receive 250 credits for free for testing the platform "
"(See :ref:`Mapflow credits <credits>`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:350 d4488055bc404c83a17d07390242edc7
msgid "6. View the results"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:352 2f6658705b7a4a9499aaac7e429aa294
msgid ""
"In the \"Processing history\" you see the progress of processing as well "
"as view and get the processing results. Each running processing displays "
"the selected model, the status, the creation date and the processing "
"cost."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:356 7b551f33f0f94da38d21ca912f7eeb6a
msgid "6.1 View on the map"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:358 b9e8bf51b3454dd1b1faefc843a21af8
msgid ""
"After the successful processing completion, the card can be opened to "
"view more detailed information about the processing parameters - AI "
"Model, Post-processing, Area, Data Source."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst 77c9fd233f1247948170554e2680046f
msgid "Processing card"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:367 ec8c56bb87ec4c37b56f6f00d727838b
